#. (itstool) path: sect1/title
#: C/index.docbook:54
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Ievads"

#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:55
msgid ""
"mate-user-share is a session service that exports the contents of the "
"<filename>Public</filename> folder in your home directory, so that they can "
"easily be accessed from other computers on the same local network. On the "
"other computers, the shared folder will appear with a name like "
"'<replaceable>user</replaceable>'s shared files' in the "
"<application>caja</application> Network window, where "
"<replaceable>user</replaceable> will be replaced by your user name."
msgstr ""
"mate-user-share ir sesijas pakalpojums, kas eksportē jūsu mājas mapē esošās "
"mapes <filename>Public</filename> saturu, lai tam varētu ērti piekļūt no "
"citiem datoriem tajā pašā lokālajā tīklā. Citos datoros koplietotā mape būs "
"redzama <application>caja</application> logā „Tīkls” ar nosaukumu, piemēram, "
"„Lietotāja <replaceable>lietotājs</replaceable> koplietotie faili”, kur "
"<replaceable>lietotājs</replaceable> vietā būs jūsu lietotājvārds."

#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:58
msgid ""
"mate-user-share uses a WebDAV server to share the "
"<filename>Public</filename> folder, and advertises the share on the local "
"network using mDNS."
msgstr ""
"mate-user-share koplieto mapi <filename>Public</filename> ar WebDAV servera "
"palīdzību un izziņo koplietojumu lokālajā tīklā, izmantojot mDNS."

#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:61
msgid ""
"Additionally, mate-user-share can make the shared files available via "
"ObexFTP over Bluetooth, and receive files that are sent to your computer via"
" Bluetooth via ObexPush."
msgstr ""
"Turklāt mate-user-share var padarīt koplietotos failus pieejamus ar ObexFTP "
"pa Bluetooth un saņemt failus, kas uz jūsu datoru sūtīti pa Bluetooth ar "
"ObexPush."

