#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:72
msgid ""
"The mate-user-share service is normally started by <application>mate-"
"session</application> when you log in. You can change this by opening "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Preferences</guimenu><guimenu>Startup "
"Applications</guimenu></menuchoice> in the <guimenu>System</guimenu> menu, "
"and modifying the 'User Sharing' entry in the list of startup programs."
msgstr ""
"Pakalpojumu mate-user-share parasti palaiž <application>mate-session</"
"application>, kad piesakāties. To var mainīt, izvēlnē <guimenu>Sistēma</"
"guimenu> atverot <menuchoice><guimenu>Iestatījumi</guimenu><guimenu>Starta "
"lietotnes</guimenu></menuchoice> un starta programmu sarakstā mainot "
"ierakstu „User Sharing”."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:76
